oli, Logic Programming with Focusing Proofs in Linear Logic, JLC 2(3) (1992) 297–347, author manuscript pp.8–12, Fig.4, Theorems1–2, <a href=\"https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~fp/courses/15816-s12/misc/andreoli92jlc.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~fp/courses/15816-s12/misc/andreoli92jlc.pdf</a> (page images checked); propositional restriction"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source theorem statement checked; full proof not reproduced or machine verified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-focusing-theorem-—-Focusing-Completeness\">thm-focusing-theorem — Focusing Completeness</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a2ddf661b9365da2\" href=\"?note=a2ddf661b9365da2\" title=\"72-df-focusing\">72-df-focusing</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_f,R_f,\\mathcal A\">\\(U_f,R_f,\\mathcal A\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_f\">\\(\\vdash_f\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta,\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M\">\\(\\Theta,\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)\\cap\\mathcal A=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)\\cap\\mathcal A=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(L\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"?\\Theta\">\\(?\\Theta\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{LL}\">\\(\\vdash_{LL}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a70f24e0154f1736\" href=\"?note=a70f24e0154f1736\" title=\"72-df-linear-logic\">72-df-linear-logic</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[L]\">\\([L]\\)</span> 是表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 忘序后得到的多重集：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[L](A)=|\\{i&lt;|L|:L_i=A\\}|\">\\([L](A)=|\\{i&lt;|L|:L_i=A\\}|\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_f(\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\vdash_{LL}(?\\Theta+\\Gamma+[L]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_f(\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\vdash_{LL}(?\\Theta+\\Gamma+[L]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\Delta\\in\\mathcal M\\quad\\left(\\vdash_{LL}\\Delta\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists L\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ ([L]=\\Delta\\land\\vdash_f(0_{\\mathcal M}:0_{\\mathcal M}\\Uparrow L))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\Delta\\in\\mathcal M\\quad\\left(\\vdash_{LL}\\Delta\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists L\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ ([L]=\\Delta\\land\\vdash_f(0_{\\mathcal M}:0_{\\mathcal M}\\Uparrow L))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式合并源Theorem1的monadic–dyadic对应与Theorem2的dyadic–triadic对应；第二式取空无限制区及空线性储存区。来源的完整证明位于附录A.1–A.2，本次只复核系统规则、定理陈述及适用条件，未宣称完整证明已验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-focusing-theorem-—-Focusing-Completeness","text":"thm-focusing-theorem — Focusing Completeness","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-focusing","status":"resolved","id":"a2ddf661b9365da2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-focusing]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · de